{"id": "tatoeba-14098724", "text": "Gli ruppe la mandibola.", "lang": "it", "source": "Tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Guybrush88", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098724", "acquisition_source": "Tatoeba API unstable/sentences 2026-11-08"}
{"id": "tatoeba-14098235", "text": "Mij viel een patroon op.", "lang": "nl", "source": "Tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "casperdewith", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098235", "acquisition_source": "Tatoeba API unstable/sentences 2026-11-08"}
{"id": "tatoeba-14097580", "text": "Ze is daar niet langer dan vier dagen gebleven.", "lang": "nl", "source": "Tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "casperdewith", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14097580", "acquisition_source": "Tatoeba API unstable/sentences 2026-11-08"}
{"id": "tatoeba-14097578", "text": "Manden vlechten is een eitje.", "lang": "nl", "source": "Tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "casperdewith", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14097578", "acquisition_source": "Tatoeba API unstable/sentences 2026-11-08"}
{"id": "tatoeba-14098145", "text": "Να χαμογελάς — να κλαις· να αγαπάς — να μισείς· να ζεις — να πεθαίνεις. Η ζωή είναι μια σειρά από αντιθέσεις.", "lang": "el", "source": "Tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "carlosalberto", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098145", "acquisition_source": "Tatoeba API unstable/sentences 2026-11-08"}
{"id": "tatoeba-14098124", "text": "Θα ήθελα να πιστεύω ότι ο θάνατος σημαίνει να είσαι συνειδητός σε άλλες διαστάσεις.", "lang": "el", "source": "Tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "carlosalberto", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098124", "acquisition_source": "Tatoeba API unstable/sentences 2026-11-08"}
{"id": "tatoeba-14098027", "text": "Έκλαψα για σένα. Τώρα κλάψε για μένα.", "lang": "el", "source": "Tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "carlosalberto", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098027", "acquisition_source": "Tatoeba API unstable/sentences 2026-11-08"}
{"id": "tatoeba-14098333", "text": "Nomina regum qui regnaverunt ibidem per ordinem fuerunt hec.", "lang": "la", "source": "Tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "opalandwoof", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098333", "acquisition_source": "Tatoeba API unstable/sentences 2026-11-08"}
{"id": "tatoeba-14098331", "text": "Thomas in proelio occisus est.", "lang": "la", "source": "Tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "opalandwoof", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098331", "acquisition_source": "Tatoeba API unstable/sentences 2026-11-08"}
{"id": "tatoeba-14098147", "text": "Subridere — flere; amare — odisse; vivere — mori. Vita est series contrariorum.", "lang": "la", "source": "Tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "carlosalberto", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098147", "acquisition_source": "Tatoeba API unstable/sentences 2026-11-08"}
